    <title>牛120bc题回顾（2维平面内分类讨论方法）</title>
    <link href="/2025/12/03/%E7%89%9B120bc%E9%A2%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%A1%BE%EF%BC%882%E7%BB%B4%E5%B9%B3%E9%9D%A2%E5%86%85%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89/"/>
    <url>/2025/12/03/%E7%89%9B120bc%E9%A2%98%E5%9B%9E%E9%A1%BE%EF%BC%882%E7%BB%B4%E5%B9%B3%E9%9D%A2%E5%86%85%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%89/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>​这是我的第一篇blog，就来复习一下牛客120的bc题（其实都挺简单的起码没用什么算法知识），这2题主要就是分类讨论，我会从题目的大致逻辑，和我得到的一些启示来说。</p><p>​b题是一个处理重复字符串的题目，这题卡了很久的原因只是因为他说字符串我就默认第一个a的序号是0，导致我处理后面模的结果的时候按0的结果来判断，但有没有在前面统一序号（l - 1）。</p><p>题目如下：</p><p>链接：<a href="https://ac.nowcoder.com/acm/contest/124977/B">https://ac.nowcoder.com/acm/contest/124977/B</a><br>来源：牛客网</p><p>小红有无穷无尽的字符串。<br>小红拿到了一个由无限个abc 依次拼接而成的字符串 abcabcabc…，她想知道从字符串的第 l位到第 r 位中，a,b,c 分别出现了多少次，请你帮帮她。</p><figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">l</span>,r(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>≦l≦r≦<span class="hljs-number">109</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs css">输出三个整数，分别代表 <span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span>,<span class="hljs-selector-tag">b</span>,ca,<span class="hljs-selector-tag">b</span>,c 出现的次数。<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c++"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> l,r,s1,s2,s3;<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>&#123;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; l &gt;&gt; r;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(l % <span class="hljs-number">3</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)&#123;<br>        s3++;<br>        l++;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(l % <span class="hljs-number">3</span> == <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)&#123;<br>        s2++;<br>        s3++;<br>        l+=<span class="hljs-number">2</span>;<br>    &#125;<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(r % <span class="hljs-number">3</span> == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)&#123;<br>    s1++;<br>    r--;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(r % <span class="hljs-number">3</span> == <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)&#123;<br>    s1++;<br>    s2++;<br>    r-=<span class="hljs-number">2</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> cnt = (r-l<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>)/<span class="hljs-number">3</span>;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d %d %d&quot;</span>,s1+cnt,s2+cnt,s3+cnt);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>大致如上，其实很简单，只是把%0以为是a，后面也就全错了。我也只能说这个题的案例出的不太好，不能让我判断序号1代表a，还是代表b。</p><hr><p>c就有点意思了。题目如下</p><p>链接：<a href="https://ac.nowcoder.com/acm/contest/123788/C">https://ac.nowcoder.com/acm/contest/123788/C</a><br>来源：牛客网</p><p>小红的马有无穷无尽的力量。</p><p>​小红拿到了一个 n×m 的棋盘，她可以在任意一个位置摆放一个马，并在之后跳任意步。她想知道，最优策略下，她的马最多可以位于多少种不同的位置？</p><p>​首先把题读懂我们可以跳任意步也可以从任意步出发，那么其实我们只需要找到马可以到那些地方就好。</p><p>​我的思路是从小例子开始尝试发现一些规律（由简到繁吗）首先如果n和吗小于2显然动不了，当他小于6时，只有2的点可达（这里就少了一种情况），然后写出3*3的例子通过模拟发现只有中间的点不可达，在扩大就要想在那里出发比较好了，试几次就会发现在角落出发显然更好，在试就会发现只要nm大于3所有点都可达。然后就没有然后了（哭）（代码如下）</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;string&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n, m;<br>cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n * m &lt; <span class="hljs-number">6</span>) &#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;1&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n * m == <span class="hljs-number">6</span>) &#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;2&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n * m == <span class="hljs-number">9</span>) &#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;8&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n * m &gt; <span class="hljs-number">9</span>) &#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; n * m &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;`<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">define</span> endl <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">typedef</span> <span class="hljs-type">long</span> <span class="hljs-type">long</span> ll;<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">solve</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>&#123;<br>    ll n,m;cin&gt;&gt;n&gt;&gt;m;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n&gt;m) <span class="hljs-built_in">swap</span>(n,m);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n==<span class="hljs-number">1</span>) cout&lt;&lt;<span class="hljs-number">1</span>&lt;&lt;endl;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n==<span class="hljs-number">2</span>) cout&lt;&lt;<span class="hljs-number">1</span>+(m<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>)/<span class="hljs-number">2</span>&lt;&lt;endl;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n==<span class="hljs-number">3</span>&amp;&amp;m==<span class="hljs-number">3</span>) cout&lt;&lt;<span class="hljs-number">8</span>&lt;&lt;endl;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(n&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">3</span>&amp;&amp;m&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">4</span>) cout&lt;&lt;n*m&lt;&lt;endl;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>&#123;<br>    cin.<span class="hljs-built_in">tie</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)-&gt;ios::<span class="hljs-built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="hljs-literal">false</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">solve</span>();<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>上面就是题解的代码，<strong>因为nm等价，所以不妨把n设为短边，减少分类讨论情况。</strong></p><p><strong>他做到不遗漏的原因是他是从短边开始1个个讨论的，而我出错的原因是我只会简单的模拟，没有按照一个标准把所有情况考虑进去。</strong></p><p>记 n<em>n</em> 为短边，m<em>m</em> 为长边，马的移动方式为 (±1,±2)(±1,±2) 或 (±2,±1)(±2,±1)。</p><p><strong>分情况讨论：</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>n&#x3D;1*n*&#x3D;1 时</strong><br>显然不能横向移动（至少需要纵向 2 格），因此只能停在起点，答案为 11。</p></li><li><p><strong>n&#x3D;2*n*&#x3D;2 时</strong><br>只能上下移动（每次纵向走 2 格横向走 1 格，但横向最大只能 1，所以是竖着“日”字形移动）。<br>因此每列最多只能经过 2 行，马可以走到的列数约为 ⌈m2⌉⌈2<em>m</em>​⌉。<br>计算答案为：</p><p>⌊m−12⌋+1⌊2<em>m</em>−1⌋+1</p></li><li><p><strong>n&#x3D;3*n*&#x3D;3 且 m&#x3D;3*m*&#x3D;3 时</strong><br>此时棋盘为 3×33×3。中心的点（第 2 行第 2 列）马无法走到（因为所有走法都会出界或重复），其余 8 个格子都能走到。<br>所以答案为 88。</p></li><li><p><strong>其余情况</strong>（n≥3<em>n</em>≥3 且 m≥4<em>m</em>≥4，或 n≥4<em>n</em>≥4）<br>棋盘足够大，马可以走到每一个格子，答案为 n×m<em>n</em>×<em>m</em>。</p></li></ol><p><strong>注意数据范围</strong>：<br>n,m<em>n</em>,<em>m</em> 最大可达 109109，n×m<em>n</em>×<em>m</em> 会达到 10181018，计算时需要使用 64 位整数（如 C++ 中的 <code>long long</code>）。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
